Photography for index.html. 7 files, exact names:

  logo-ag-vending.png    header logo, renders at 34px height, transparent PNG
  hero-sjalfsali.jpg     hero photo, 4:5 portrait, object-fit: cover
                         also the og:image, so it is what shows in link previews
  machine-tvofaldur.png  double smart machine, cut-out on white, 300px well, contain
  machine-einfaldur.png  single smart machine, cut-out on white
  machine-snertiskjar.png  55-inch touchscreen machine, cut-out on white
  portrait-theodor.png   testimonial portrait, 42px circle, cover
  portrait-stefan.jpg    testimonial portrait, 42px circle, cover

All seven currently exist only on the Squarespace CDN. Download them before
the Squarespace account is cancelled — once it closes they are gone.

The product cards are built for studio cut-outs on white: a 300px-tall well
with object-fit: contain. Shoot the machine screens off or masked if the kiosk
flow video is still on the table, so it can be composited in later.

/assets/* is served with Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable.
To replace a photo later, give the new file a different name and update the
reference in index.html rather than overwriting.

Delete this file once all 7 are here.
